oads\/2024\/09\/DL-Avegant-PR-graphic-090424-01-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/DL-Avegant-PR-graphic-090424-01-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/DL-Avegant-PR-graphic-090424-01-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/DL-Avegant-PR-graphic-090424-01.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-105baed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"105baed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">DigiLens Partners with Avegant to Deliver Compact and Manufacturable Full-Color Transparent Displays for Next-Generation AI Smartglasses<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fe6035 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3fe6035\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">This strategic collaboration aligns cutting-edge light engine technology with the global leader in scalable waveguide manufacturing, performance, and price<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12c1282 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"12c1282\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f3bd1e8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"f3bd1e8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ab34f7b\" data-id=\"ab34f7b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ad14d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9ad14d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Silicon Valley, CA \u2014 September 4, 2024:\u00a0<\/strong>DigiLens Inc., a leading nanotechnology innovator in waveguide display technologies and XR smartglasses, has teamed up with Avegant, a leading expert in light engine technology, to provide transparent, efficient, and affordable displays for the next-generation of AI-enabled smartglasses. By combining DigiLens\u2019 holographic waveguide technology with Avegant\u2019s light engine expertise, customers can design lightweight and stylish augmented reality (AR) smartglasses, perfect for the consumer market.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-89d14f1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"89d14f1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Begin your evaluation journey today by purchasing an Insight Kit directly from DigiLens. The Insight Kit includes the\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/optics\/\">DigiLens Crystal30 waveguides<\/a>\u00a0and the Avegant AG-30L2 AR light engine, allowing customers to swiftly create and view content through the module. The combination of Avegant\u2019s light engine and DigiLens\u2019 waveguides delivers a daylight-bright image of over 3,000nits.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24d550a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"24d550a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u201cAvegant is excited to join the DigiLens ecosystem as they are known to be leaders in performance and cost for waveguides, making them an ideal partner for AI consumer smartglasses,\u201d said Ed Tang, CEO of Avegant. \u201cDigiLens can manufacture waveguides at scale with high yield that can enable consumer price points. The combination of DigiLens and Avegant delivers a 1,000nits display at only 75mW of illumination power\u201d.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca4d5ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ca4d5ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>DigiLens\u2019 efficient waveguides power consumer, enterprise, and industrial products like smartglasses, helmets, and other headworn devices, and can accommodate various light engines based on customer preferences. The Crystal30 is backed by DigiLens\u2019 global licensee network, enabling large-scale volume manufacturing to meet consumer market demands.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b6d84f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5b6d84f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.avegant.com\/products.html\">Avegant\u2019s AG-30L2 AR light engine<\/a>\u00a0is extremely compact, efficient, and high-resolution, featuring liquid crystal on silicon (LCoS) technology with a volume as low as 1.4cc. This light engine supports small and sleek form factors and utilizes proprietary illumination technology to significantly reduce engine volume and weight while preserving efficiency and modulation transfer function (MTF).<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee3751c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ee3751c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u201cLight engines drive every AR product,\u201d said Chris Pickett, DigiLens CEO. \u201cBuilding upon years of light engine research, design, and manufacturing, Avegant offers cutting-edge technologies that bring compact, efficient, and manufacturable AR light engines to the marketplace.\u201d<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1b6ba8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c1b6ba8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Insight Kits can be purchased from DigiLens by\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/contact\/\">submitting an inquiry online<\/a>\u00a0or emailing\u00a0<a href=\"about:blank\">sales@digilens.com<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c01fe87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c01fe87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>###<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-652d2c3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"652d2c3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-20f1b7c\" data-id=\"20f1b7c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40c8afb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"40c8afb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><b>About Avegant<br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\">Avegant is a well-funded, venture-backed technology company developing next-generation display technology to enable previously impossible augmented reality experiences. The company uses its deep scientific understanding of human sight and head-mounted display ergonomics together with its consumer electronics manufacturing experience to develop displays that enable realistic AR experiences for consumers. Avegant\u2019s AR Light Engines will enable customers to provide a compelling AR experience in a consumer wearable AR device. For more information, visit avegant.com.<\/span><\/p><p><em>Press Contact<\/em><br \/>Annie Rogaski<br \/><a href=\"mailto:contact@avegant.com\">contact@avegant.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2483c86 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2483c86\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-958d68b elementor-widget elementor-widget-global elementor-global-24667 elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"958d68b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><strong>About DigiLens Inc.<br \/><\/strong>DigiLens is a leader in holographic waveguides used for XR displays. The company has developed a patented optical platform and photopolymer technology that deliver best-in-class solutions using a unique, low-cost contact-copy manufacturing process. DigiLens enables OEM partners to design and build XR-enabled devices for the global automobile, enterprise, consumer, avionics, and defense industries. Based in Sunnyvale, CA, DigiLens\u2019 investors include industry leaders like Samsung Electronics, Samsung Electro-Mechanics, Diamond Edge Ventures, the strategic investment arm of Mitsubishi Chemical Holdings Corporation, Alsop Louie Partners, Optimas Capital Management, 37 Interactive Entertainment, UDC Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Universal Display Corporation, Niantic, Inc., Sony Innovation Fund, Dolby Family Ventures, Continental AG, and more.<\/p><p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><strong>Press Contact<\/strong><br \/>Brian Hamilton<br \/><a href=\"mailto:brian.hamilton@DigiLens.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Brian.Hamilton@DigiLens.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Strategic collaboratio